      ],
      "finding": "Enumerator gates selfAlternativeCost.condition and prices alternative base; handler independently rechecks condition and uses exact declared base in validation and execution. Selection discriminator is explicit. Qualify {1}{R}, red failure, reduction/tax, equal cost and competing GRANTED paths; do not infer choice from spend."
    },
    {
      "boundary": "cast history and reset",
      "files": [
        "rules-engine/src/main/kotlin/com/wingedsheep/engine/state/GameState.kt",
