        "rules-engine/src/main/kotlin/com/wingedsheep/engine/core/TurnManager.kt"
      ],
      "finding": "PlayerCastSpellsThisTurn reads spellsCastThisTurnByPlayer, not live stack. Cast handler appends history on commit; TurnManager resets both trackers. R2 H0-H5/serialized H2,H4 evidence is reused unchanged."
    },
    {
      "boundary": "stack persistence copying and source identity",
      "files": [
        "rules-engine/src/main/kotlin/com/wingedsheep/engine/mechanics/stack/StackResolver.kt",
