        "rules-engine/src/main/kotlin/com/wingedsheep/engine/handlers/effects/ZoneMovementUtils.kt"
      ],
      "finding": "putSpellCopy uses sourceSpell.copy, preserving alternativeCost. Permanent resolution transfers explicit choice to durable bag. Paid-choice evaluator uses original captured source/LKI; departure strips new-object choices. Existing original-source proof is reused. New printed-card copy and blink integrations still need qualification."
    },
    {
      "boundary": "entry and intervening condition",
      "files": [
        "rules-engine/src/main/kotlin/com/wingedsheep/engine/event/TriggerDetector.kt",
        "rules-engine/src/main/kotlin/com/wingedsheep/engine/event/TriggerMatcher.kt",
