        "mtg-sdk/src/main/kotlin/com/wingedsheep/sdk/dsl/CardBuilder.kt"
      ],
      "finding": "Use triggeredAbility with Triggers.EntersBattlefield and interveningIf Conditions.CastChoiceMade(SELF_ALTERNATIVE), not unconditional trigger + incidental mana test. Detection and StackResolver recheck condition. Opponents may respond or counter the ability."
    },
    {
      "boundary": "recipient set and minimal engine seam",
      "files": [
        "rules-engine/src/main/kotlin/com/wingedsheep/engine/handlers/effects/composite/ForEachExecutor.kt",
        "rules-engine/src/main/kotlin/com/wingedsheep/engine/handlers/effects/BattlefieldFilterUtils.kt",
        "rules-engine/src/main/kotlin/com/wingedsheep/engine/handlers/effects/EffectExecutorRegistry.kt"
      ],
      "finding": "ForEach snapshots projected recipients; inner Self binds iteration entity. Static source review finds excludeSelfId=context.sourceId ignores original object generation. Narrow proposed correction: for captured/origin-bound contexts exclude original origin only if state.isCurrentObject(origin); never follow permitted moves or substitute selfBinding/new generation. Preserve unbound legacy source-ID fallback; no changes to excludeTarget/chosenSubtype/controller/type logic. GX01-GX10 and BW15/BW17 verify this seam. This is source analysis, not a claimed executed failure."
    },
    {
      "boundary": "temporary stats haste cleanup",
      "files": [
        "rules-engine/src/main/kotlin/com/wingedsheep/engine/handlers/effects/permanent/stats/ModifyStatsExecutor.kt",
