        "rules-engine/src/main/kotlin/com/wingedsheep/engine/core/CleanupPhaseManager.kt"
      ],
      "finding": "Compose ForEachInGroup(GroupFilter(Creature.youControl()).other(), Composite(ModifyStats(1,0,Self,EndOfTurn), GrantKeyword(HASTE,Self,EndOfTurn))). Snapshot membership at resolution; intrinsic Haste stays on source. Existing effects emit events and store floating effects; cleanup removes EndOfTurn. Test departed source, projected creatures, end-step/cleanup and later entrants."
    },
    {
